+# BP-032 – Demo lifecycle and timedemo parity
+
+- Reproduces the original byte-at-a-time forced-track parser, including its odd non-digit arithmetic.
+- Stores recorded view angles at the original binary32 file boundary.
+- Applies the original float boundary to timedemo elapsed time and FPS.
+- Adds 20 recording, framing, playback, keepalive and timedemo fixtures.
